hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1308","Abu Qudamah told us, Wahb bin Jarir told us, Mahdi bin Maymun told us, on the authority of Wasil, the client of Ibn Uyaynah, on the authority of Yahya bin Aqeel, on the authority of Yahya bin Yamar, on the authority of Abu Aswad al-Dili, on the authority of Abu Dharr, said: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The deeds of my nation were presented to me, their good ones.” And her bad deeds, I found in the virtues of her deeds the removal of harm from the way, and I found in the worst of her deeds the fact that she remained in the mosque without being buried.”"
